Feature: Checkout Flow with Nested Iframes # features/checkout.feature:1

  @regression
  Scenario: Pay inside nested iframe and verify order           # features/checkout.feature:3
    Given I navigate to the "Add to Cart" page                  # features/steps/common_steps.py:28
    When I fill the "Card Number" field with "4242424242424242" # features/steps/common_steps.py:48
    And I fill the "OTP" field with "123456"                    # features/steps/common_steps.py:48
    And I check the "Terms" checkbox                            # features/steps/common_steps.py:54
    And After I click the "Add to Cart" button it is disabled   # features/steps/common_steps.py:79
    Then the "Order Row" label for "A-1001" should be visible   # features/steps/common_steps.py:131

